<title>USA: Petro Plus president Casavant resigns.</title>
<headline>Petro Plus president Casavant resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petro Plus Inc said late Friday, after the market closed, that Urban Casavant has resigned as president of the company.</p>
<p>In a press release, Petro Plus said that it has named Randy Studer president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The company also said that it has named N. Ralph Newson chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Further information was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
